00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:24.990
(peaceful instrumental music)

00:00:33.986 --> 00:00:36.426
- I didn't know Trump had a vodka.

00:00:36.426 --> 00:00:38.583
- I guess he kind of looks
like he just took a shot.

00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:40.943
- This is like his skin color.

00:00:40.943 --> 00:00:42.323
(laughing)

00:00:42.323 --> 00:00:43.742
- The world's finest...

00:00:43.742 --> 00:00:45.701
