00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:46.440
What is it?

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.200
"The Netherlands?"

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.197
That's not America.

00:00:48.197 --> 00:00:50.257
- It's probably gonna taste like misogyny.

00:00:50.257 --> 00:00:51.237
- Inequality.

00:00:51.237 --> 00:00:54.015
- This vodka is going to
taste like self tanner.

00:00:54.015 --> 00:00:55.465
- Pray for me.
- [Man] L'Chaim!

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.455
- Wait, it's a cork.

00:00:58.455 --> 00:00:59.513
- Ooo!

00:00:59.513 --> 00:01:00.333
(chuckling)

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:01.828
- Do I have to do all that?

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:02.945
That was a lot.

00:01:02.945 --> 00:01:05.264
- Uh oh!

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:05.885
- There you go.
- [Man Two] Yeah?

00:01:05.885 --> 00:01:07.059
- I can do that.

00:01:07.059 --> 00:01:07.596
(clinking glasses together)

00:01:07.596 --> 00:01:08.726
- Okay, let's go.

00:01:13.076 --> 00:01:15.713
(exclaiming in disgust)

00:01:15.713 --> 00:01:17.313
- [Both] Cheers!

00:01:17.313 --> 00:01:18.693
- I'm so afraid.

00:01:18.693 --> 00:01:20.470
- That is surprisingly good.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.810
- Ooo, ooo, that burns like a UTI.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.448
