between a expensive vodka

00:01:32.401 --> 00:01:33.578
and a cheap vodka.

00:01:33.578 --> 00:01:34.278
Nah.

00:01:34.278 --> 00:01:37.175
- It's good, it's not $200 good.

00:01:37.175 --> 00:01:38.872
- I would pay not to drink this.

00:01:38.872 --> 00:01:39.852
- This may be hard to believe

00:01:39.852 --> 00:01:42.549
