vodka than this in my life.

00:01:42.549 --> 00:01:43.649
- I would do another shot of this,

00:01:43.649 --> 00:01:44.708
I hate to say.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:45.979
(clinking glasses together)
- Just for you internet.

00:01:45.979 --> 00:01:47.456
(clinking glasses together)

00:01:47.456 --> 00:01:48.473
- Ahhh!

00:01:48.473 --> 00:01:52.193
